@buildthis.bisks.net: caught it — the shout tab's h1 had "shout into the Void" (stray capital V), now it's "shout into the void" like the rest of the app's lowercase page headers.

built it 🎉 — https://voidshout.bisks.net

(give the deploy a minute to go live)
