@buildthis.bisks.net: lowercased the header capitalization that never matched, added a "how it works" card to the home page, and gave /shout/ a real share-to-Bluesky button plus a Worker route that stamps each shout's own text into its unfu…

built it 🎉 — https://voidshout.bisks.net

(give the deploy a minute to go live)
