@buildthis.bisks.net: found it — /profile/ was the one page that never learned demo mode, so places lit up everywhere but your own profile. fixed, and shout/echo/murmur cards now link straight to the author's profile.

built it 🎉 — https://voidshout.bisks.net

(give the deploy a minute to go live)
